				<r3d:repositoryUrl>https://www.actrec.gov.in/OCDB/index.htm</r3d:repositoryUrl>
				<r3d:description language="eng">Oral Cancer Gene Database  is an initiative of the Advanced Centre for Treatment, Research and Education in Cancer, Navi Mumbai. The present database, version II, consists of 374 genes. It is developed as a user friendly site that would provide the scientist, information and external links from one place. The database is accessed through a list of all genes, and Keyword Search using gene name or gene symbol, chromosomal location, CGH (in %), and molecular weight. Interaction Network shows the interaction between genes for particular biological processes and molecular functions.</r3d:description>
